    "chunk_text": "we, of haran sprecele, hegerifan, genim healfe \u00fea B\u00e6\u00fe wi\u00fe \u00feam miclan lice, eolone, brom, ifig, mucwyrt, \u00e6lf\u00feone, beolone, cottuc, efelastan, wyl on Drince \u00feisne drenc wi\u00fe \u00feon, betonican, curmille, hofe, agrimonia, springwyrt, reade netle, elehtre, Sealf wi\u00fe \u00feam miclan lice, elene, \u00feung, ompre, grundeswelge, hole cersan, wegbr\u00e6de, efelaste, Wi\u00f0 swile genim wegbr\u00e6dan nio\u00feowearde, gecnuwa wi\u00fe rysele, lege & gebind on \u00feone swile. Drencas & sealfa wi\u00fe springe, springwyrt, reade hofe, wegbr\u00e6de, fefer fuge, aprotane, mage\u00fee, Gif he on earan sie gebeate wegbr\u00e6dan & fefer fugean & pipor, wring on \u00fe\u00e6t eare. To sealfe wi\u00f0 springe nim dolhrunan wegbr\u00e6dan, mage\u00fean, \u00feone bradan cawel nio\u00feoweardne, Sealf eft medowyrt, acumban, hind hiolo\u00f0e, gearwe, cneowholen, \u00e6\u00feelfer\u00f0ing wyrt, agrimonia. Wi\u00fe deadum springe, wyl on buteran self\u00e6tan, \u00e6fter\u00feam & springwyrt. Wi\u00fe springe, mage\u00fea, wudu merce, wyrc to sealfe, drince gode wyrta. Wi\u00fe springe nim elehtran, gecnuwa on hunig, meng to somne, lege on \u00feone swile o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t hal sie. Wi\u00f0 springe, springwyrt, cerfillan & hunig & gose smera gecnuwa, wyl to somne, lege",
